      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_58f2fe49ad6d0d4419d6",
      "document_start": 38,
      "document_end": 58,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 1;",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_ae82190e0cb496b03e67",
      "document_start": 59,
      "document_end": 66,
      "text": "# 一、物体;",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e7dfd66338f137e58860",
      "document_start": 67,
      "document_end": 99,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_31ecdf7a90562aa8bebe",
      "document_start": 101,
      "document_end": 115,
      "text": "多体系统中的构件定义为物体。",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_44d74424e36218d0467f",
      "document_start": 115,
      "document_end": 149,
      "text": "多体系统力学模型中物体的定义并不一定与具体工程对象的零部件一一对应。",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_df5bebc05c3ea1badb13",
      "document_start": 149,
      "document_end": 162,
      "text": "它的定义与研究的目的有关。",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_354f117a66d66d149f47",
      "document_start": 162,
      "document_end": 192,
      "text": "在运动学分析中，通常对其运动性态特别关心的零部件定义为物体。",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_9f90df4e2b23fb8c4e45",
      "document_start": 192,
      "document_end": 203,
      "text": "其次是物体性质的假定。",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_f3a8776c0eb363ac87f0",
      "document_start": 203,
      "document_end": 240,
      "text": "对于低速运动的实际工程对象，其零部件的弹性变形并不影响其大范围的运动性态。",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_6f7223b37fb2accf891d",
      "document_start": 240,
      "document_end": 260,
      "text": "在这种情况下，系统中的物体可作刚体假定。",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e30c7241382fe2a1deb0",
      "document_start": 260,
      "document_end": 275,
      "text": "这样的多体系统称为多刚体系统。",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_9520ab1f11c4f42c05e3",
      "document_start": 275,
      "document_end": 340,
      "text": "由于大型、轻质机械系统的出现，高速运行的工况将使系统动力学性态越来越复杂，这些现象由于零部件的大范围运动与构件的弹性变形耦合引起。",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_d37d35a4c2b0e3ec5025",
      "document_start": 340,
      "document_end": 363,
      "text": "在分析这类系统动力学时，物体必须作柔性体假定。",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_d52c5d3d4d8beaaab47a",
      "document_start": 363,
      "document_end": 378,
      "text": "这类力学模型称为柔性多体系统。",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_efc1f849103107eadab5",
      "document_start": 378,
      "document_end": 429,
      "text": "如果上述系统中部分物体仍可作刚体假定，则构成的力学模型为刚一柔混合多体系统，它是多系统中最一般的模型。",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_43e01a3629d37399aa0c",
      "document_start": 431,
      "document_end": 451,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e780dd5d7411cb76aad2",
      "document_start": 452,
      "document_end": 458,
      "text": "# 二、铰;",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_70e92ff0778b29336fa5",
      "document_start": 459,
      "document_end": 491,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_5d73df19b4579d55c77f",
      "document_start": 493,
      "document_end": 549,
      "text": "在多体系统中将物体间的运动约束定义为铰，实际工程对象中机构的运动副是铰的物理背景，然而铰的定义具有更广泛的意义。",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_bc729c83b5cbbbc60c28",
      "document_start": 549,
      "document_end": 599,
      "text": "对于上述的三体动力学模型中，滑块不作为物体，但它限制了连杆与机座间的运动，这种约束的力学抽象即为铰。",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_177be8a113a574100a94",
      "document_start": 601,
      "document_end": 621,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 3;",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_a278b2c3e160a7693561",
      "document_start": 622,
      "document_end": 632,
      "text": "# 三、外力（偶）;",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_b95809275b682e1887bf",
      "document_start": 633,
      "document_end": 665,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_429e559ac29ddfb9db4e",
      "document_start": 667,
      "document_end": 694,
      "text": "多体系统外的物体对系统中的物体的作用定义为外力(偶)。",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_a37b3b8c706c035026ac",
      "document_start": 694,
      "document_end": 703,
      "text": "重力是典型的外力。",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_0aa4520fb36d76a12984",
      "document_start": 703,
      "document_end": 733,
      "text": "在外力的定义中需要注意的是对于刚体，力偶的作用与作用点无关。",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_3ce3b841edf75c554973",
      "document_start": 733,
      "document_end": 754,
      "text": "然而，对于柔性体，力偶的作用与作用点有关。",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_b1d9be6fdf9a0dc5486b",
      "document_start": 754,
      "document_end": 768,
      "text": "因为它对其弹性变形均有影响。",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_8812477221442c23aea5",
      "document_start": 768,
      "document_end": 818,
      "text": "此外，如果在实际的工程对象中外力作用的零部件没有作物体的定义，则在多体系统的力学模型中应定义外力作用",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_aa86d2e3fe311c60eff6",
      "document_start": 820,
      "document_end": 840,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 4;",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_edba61e6d0f2020b0636",
      "document_start": 841,
      "document_end": 848,
      "text": "# 四、力元;",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e9ebcbe3bf2284277ce7",
      "document_start": 849,
      "document_end": 881,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_5a6f4bbd91f2710cb84c",
      "document_start": 883,
      "document_end": 903,
      "text": "在多体系统中物体间的相互作用定义为力元。",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_6924e313afae9f9e2ac7",
      "document_start": 903,
      "document_end": 942,
      "text": "在实际的工程对象中，零部件间的相互联系一种是通过运动副，另一种通过力相互作用。",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_f7d13dbfc60ec6742011",
      "document_start": 942,
      "document_end": 979,
      "text": "两者的本质差异为前者限制了相连物体的相对运动的自由度，后者却没有这种限制。",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_17a5b443e187c28a013b",
      "document_start": 979,
      "document_end": 1001,
      "text": "在实际工程中，力元的作用也是通过器件实现的。",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_8d31f774eac391502775",
      "document_start": 1001,
      "document_end": 1047,
      "text": "如物体间的线弹簧阻尼器或油压作动筒，如果不计它们的质量，则它们在多体系统中的力学模型为力元。",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2486233f5b381e37b4b4",
      "document_start": 1047,
      "document_end": 1076,
      "text": "实际工程对象中系统零部件的相互作用也可借助于运动副来实现。",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_1f8312b639a3bb993e12",
      "document_start": 1076,
      "document_end": 1093,
      "text": "如转动铰上的卷簧、阻尼与电动机等。",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_75317ce8dd696483d2f2",
      "document_start": 1093,
      "document_end": 1118,
      "text": "此时将运动副定义为铰，物体间的相互作用定义为力元。",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_d565b48f8f7f4943f0bd",
      "document_start": 1118,
      "document_end": 1178,
      "text": "综上所述，实际机械系统多体动力学模型定义取决于研究的目的，模型定义的要点是以能揭示系统运动学与动力学性态的最简模型为优。",
      "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66"
    }
  ],
