        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_429e559ac29ddfb9db4e",
          "document_start": 667,
          "document_end": 694,
          "text": "多体系统外的物体对系统中的物体的作用定义为外力(偶)。",
          "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66",
          "start": 667,
          "end": 694,
          "chunk_start": 667,
          "chunk_end": 694,
          "sentence_document_start": 667,
          "sentence_document_end": 694,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_a37b3b8c706c035026ac",
          "document_start": 694,
          "document_end": 703,
          "text": "重力是典型的外力。",
          "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66",
          "start": 694,
          "end": 703,
          "chunk_start": 694,
          "chunk_end": 703,
          "sentence_document_start": 694,
          "sentence_document_end": 703,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_0aa4520fb36d76a12984",
          "document_start": 703,
          "document_end": 733,
          "text": "在外力的定义中需要注意的是对于刚体，力偶的作用与作用点无关。",
          "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66",
          "start": 703,
          "end": 733,
          "chunk_start": 703,
          "chunk_end": 733,
          "sentence_document_start": 703,
          "sentence_document_end": 733,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_3ce3b841edf75c554973",
          "document_start": 733,
          "document_end": 754,
          "text": "然而，对于柔性体，力偶的作用与作用点有关。",
          "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66",
          "start": 733,
          "end": 754,
          "chunk_start": 733,
          "chunk_end": 754,
          "sentence_document_start": 733,
          "sentence_document_end": 754,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_b1d9be6fdf9a0dc5486b",
          "document_start": 754,
          "document_end": 768,
          "text": "因为它对其弹性变形均有影响。",
          "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66",
          "start": 754,
          "end": 768,
          "chunk_start": 754,
          "chunk_end": 768,
          "sentence_document_start": 754,
          "sentence_document_end": 768,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_8812477221442c23aea5",
          "document_start": 768,
          "document_end": 818,
          "text": "此外，如果在实际的工程对象中外力作用的零部件没有作物体的定义，则在多体系统的力学模型中应定义外力作用",
