        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_5a6f4bbd91f2710cb84c",
          "document_start": 883,
          "document_end": 903,
          "text": "在多体系统中物体间的相互作用定义为力元。",
          "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66",
          "start": 883,
          "end": 903,
          "chunk_start": 883,
          "chunk_end": 903,
          "sentence_document_start": 883,
          "sentence_document_end": 903,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_6924e313afae9f9e2ac7",
          "document_start": 903,
          "document_end": 942,
          "text": "在实际的工程对象中，零部件间的相互联系一种是通过运动副，另一种通过力相互作用。",
          "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66",
          "start": 903,
          "end": 942,
          "chunk_start": 903,
          "chunk_end": 942,
          "sentence_document_start": 903,
          "sentence_document_end": 942,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_f7d13dbfc60ec6742011",
          "document_start": 942,
          "document_end": 979,
          "text": "两者的本质差异为前者限制了相连物体的相对运动的自由度，后者却没有这种限制。",
          "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66",
          "start": 942,
          "end": 979,
          "chunk_start": 942,
          "chunk_end": 979,
          "sentence_document_start": 942,
          "sentence_document_end": 979,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_17a5b443e187c28a013b",
          "document_start": 979,
          "document_end": 1001,
          "text": "在实际工程中，力元的作用也是通过器件实现的。",
          "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66",
          "start": 979,
          "end": 1001,
          "chunk_start": 979,
          "chunk_end": 1001,
          "sentence_document_start": 979,
          "sentence_document_end": 1001,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_8d31f774eac391502775",
          "document_start": 1001,
          "document_end": 1047,
          "text": "如物体间的线弹簧阻尼器或油压作动筒，如果不计它们的质量，则它们在多体系统中的力学模型为力元。",
          "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66",
          "start": 1001,
          "end": 1047,
          "chunk_start": 1001,
          "chunk_end": 1047,
          "sentence_document_start": 1001,
          "sentence_document_end": 1047,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_2486233f5b381e37b4b4",
          "document_start": 1047,
          "document_end": 1076,
          "text": "实际工程对象中系统零部件的相互作用也可借助于运动副来实现。",
          "section_id": "section_e7bc064d6c66",
          "start": 1047,
